		font-size: 16px;
		font-weight: bold;
	}

	.search-container {
		padding: 16px;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #404040;
	}

	.search-input {
		width: 100%;
		padding: 8px 12px;
		background: #1e1e1e;
		border: 1px solid #404040;
		border-radius: 4px;
		color: #e0e0e0;
		font-size: 14px;
	}

		.search-input:focus {
			outline: none;
			border-color: #007acc;
